<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN 146 FOR 4 V SRI LANKA AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN 146 FOR 4 V SRI LANKA AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan were 146 for 4 in reply to Sri Lanka's first innings total of 331 at close of play on the second day of the second and final test match on Sunday.</p>
</text>
